title: Snap Elections Called
view-if: chancellor = "Staal" and staal_time and not staal_post_protests and reichstag_break and gnu_total_votes >= 35
on-arrival: {!
Q.reichstag_rubicon = 0;
Q.reichstag_break = 0;

Q.next_election_week = Q.week + 6;
Q.next_election_month = Q.month;
Q.next_election_year = Q.year;
Q.next_election_time = Q.time;

let added_months = Math.floor(Q.next_election_week / 4);
Q.next_election_month += added_months;
Q.next_election_time += added_months;
Q.next_election_week = Q.next_election_week % 4;
if (Q.next_election_week === 0) Q.next_election_week = 1;

if (Q.next_election_month > 12) {
    Q.next_election_month -= 12;
    Q.next_election_year += 1;
}
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
max-visits: 1
priority: 2

= Snap Elections Called

Chancellor Staal and the <span style="color: #BFC8CC;">**GNU**</span> now see an opportunity to dramatically boost their seat share in fresh elections—paving the way to consolidate power and govern outright with only the loyal <span style="color: #6A1E1E;">**DSU**</span>, free from parliamentarianism.

New Assembly elections are scheduled for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +], Week [+ next_election_week +].

- @prussia_election

@prussia_election
title: Staal pressures [+ heartland_leader +] for a double dissolution.
view-if: heartland_leader != "Goodlake" and heartland_leader != "Crowde"

Staal communicates to [+ heartland_leader +] that a double dissolution of the chambers of the Commonwealth and Heartland is necessary for the legislature of the former to be accurate to the updated opinions of the people. The threat of federal action is also present.

- @prussia_election_2

@prussia_election_2
title: [+ heartland_leader +] bends to pressure.
on-arrival: next_election_week_heartland = next_election_week if rubicon and next_election_time - time < 3; next_election_week_heartland = week + 6 if rubicon and next_election_time - time >= 3; next_election_week_heartland -= 4 if rubicon and next_election_week_heartland > 4; next_election_week_heartland -= 4 if rubicon and next_election_week_heartland > 4
call: set_next_election_time_prussia

New state Assembly elections are scheduled for [+ next_election_month_heartland : month +] [+ next_election_year_heartland +], Week [+ next_election_week +].